      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LITTLE SKITTLES (7) goes very well over this trip including five wins. Missed the frame latest (22.94) when fifth over 400m at this track in a Grade 4/5. Appeals as a leading chance in this. WAVE OF FUN (1) was on speed settling but found some traffic when collided with another runner, finishing fourth (22.07) at Cannington in a Free For All. Can measure up this time. SUNSET SILENCE (4) was a strong winner (22.19) from box 2 last time, scoring by 4 lengths at this track. Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. OOSTHUIZEN (2) generally performs well from this box.",
